5,1,1,talk,Victoria,,We need to be realistic about who is actually going to run these plans. I'll check the roster books for the late-turn pool and the crew establishment and maintenance contract.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm tired of us forgetting the past. I'm looking into the completion records of the earlier accessibility programme and those two pilots from eight years ago.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I want to know about the hidden risks. I'll examine the contingency pricing inside the pre-war shells and the joint operators' committee minutes.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I worry about the money. I'll look at the balances in the capital ledger and the ticketing contractor fees and paving rates.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I want to see where the time actually goes! I'll check the timed runs and crowd counts mid-city and the journey audits on where minutes go.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Takumi, do you think the old pilots will actually apply to current staffing levels?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"Maybe not, but at least we'll know if the idea itself was a failure.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Victoria, your focus on crews is wise. The physical site is only half the battle.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I just hope we don't pick something we can't afford in three years.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Sakura,,Exactly! Let's make sure we're fixing the right problems first.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
